# Scripts directory (working scripts) - EXCEPT the explicitly named ones below.
# MUST be `scripts/*`, not `scripts/`: git cannot re-include a file whose PARENT
# DIRECTORY is excluded, so with `scripts/` every `!scripts/...` line below was
# inert and new files were silently untracked. The already-tracked ones survived
# only because gitignore does not apply to files already in the index.
scripts/*
!scripts/pr_overlap_guard.py
!scripts/r2_pdf_uploader.py
